# Trivy vulnerability-ignore list for the codingenv image
# (used via --ignorefile in .gitea/workflows/codingenv-rebuild.yml).
#
# npm bundled with node 24.20.0 pins transitive deps whose fixes are
# published upstream (brace-expansion >= 5.0.9, ip-address >= 10.3.1,
# tar >= 7.5.22), but they are unreachable right now: fresh npm installs
# are broken (@npmcli/docs was unpublished from the npm registry) and an
# in-place `npm install -g npm@...` keeps the old pinned versions.
#
# Re-check after every NODE_VERSION bump (codingenv/.env.sample): once a Node
# release bundles an npm with the fixed pins, remove the entries below.

CVE-2026-14257
CVE-2026-69152
CVE-2026-69192
CVE-2026-73566

# Added 2026-09-30, same situation: npm's bundled brace-expansion 5.0.7
# (fixed >= 5.0.10 / 5.0.11) and undici 6.27.0 (fixed >= 6.28.1). No npm
# release bundles the fixed versions yet -- not even npm 12.1.0 (latest,
# brace-expansion 5.0.9 / undici 6.28.0), nor the npm in Node 24.21.0 LTS /
# 26.10.0 (npm 11.19.x). Remove once a Node/npm release ships them.
CVE-2026-102276
CVE-2026-102278
CVE-2026-19534

# Added 2026-10-10 in the (since removed) claude-env/opencode-env images,
# carried over on 2026-10-23 when gh/glab/tea landed here: gh (GitHub CLI,
# from cli.github.com's apt repo) 2.102.0 is built with Go 1.27.1 +
# golang.org/x/net 0.58.0, which carry three fixable
# HIGH DoS CVEs: net/http Range-header handling (server-side; gh is a
# client), crypto/tls ECH extension parsing, and HTTP/2 SETTINGS flooding
# (CVE-2026-78669, in both stdlib and x/net). Fixed in Go 1.27.2 / 1.26.9 and
# x/net 0.60.0, but no gh release is built with them yet. Remove once a
# newer gh lands (the apt layer picks it up on the next rebuild).
#
# Same three ids, same state, also cover tea 0.16.0 (Gitea CLI; Go 1.26.6 +
# x/net 0.57.0, no tea release with Go >= 1.26.9 yet). glab was clean when
# this was added. Re-check gh and tea before removing any of these: only drop
# an id once neither binary is reported for it.
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-97031
CVE-2026-78669
